      "key": "CoreRuntime.public-operations",
      "text": "Adding a public method on CoreRuntime changes a checked API contract. The allowlist test compares the sorted public callables declared by CoreRuntime with core_runtime_operations in CORE_PUBLIC_API_ALLOWLIST.json. A new method requires a matching entry in that list.",
      "reviewed_commit": "314eb47490adcad22e37d6e05d2da3983e78956d",
