          "blob": "b718b35207f00f9d99228f11dace383e8ff4c313"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "recall.evidence",
      "text": "After Core selects a neighborhood, Access resolves the returned handles from a single read of the canonical bindings. In Core order, each item returns the current statement's text only if it matches the atom payload. A missing binding, missing or corrupt evidence, or a payload mismatch yields an item-level error.",
      "reviewed_commit": "8a29bb509c972897c4b5d59a901715be23be604f",
      "evidence": [
